sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant FE as Frontend
  participant API as Backend routes
  participant ENG as engine
  participant DB as SQLite
  FE->>API: POST /profiles (consent=true, work text, skills)
  API->>DB: INSERT profile
  API-->>FE: 201 Profile
  FE->>API: POST /profiles/{id}/extract
  API->>ENG: suggest(declared, texts)
  ENG-->>API: suggestions + verbatim evidence quotes
  API->>DB: store extraction
  API-->>FE: suggestions
  FE->>API: POST /profiles/{id}/confirm (a decision for each)
  API->>DB: store confirmed skills
  FE->>API: GET /recommendations
  API->>ENG: rank(confirmed levels, roles, interests)
  ENG-->>API: ranked roles, gaps, hours
  API-->>FE: recommendations + goal role
  FE->>API: POST /plan {role_id}
  API->>ENG: build_plan(...)
  API->>DB: store plan (active)
  API-->>FE: plan steps
  FE->>API: POST /progress {step, percent}
  API->>DB: upsert progress
  API->>ENG: detect_event + select message
  API-->>FE: progress + next_message
